<title>USA: Cellular Comms 1996 loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Cellular Comms 1996 loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		    $4.85   profit	 $0.45</p>
<p> Net loss		   50,968   profit	 5,341</p>
<p> Revs			 29,850		   14,636</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 net includes $0.12/shr charge for early extinguishment of debt.</p>
<p>Revs is equity in net loss of Omnitel Pronto Italia.</p>
<p>Full company name is Cellular Communications International Inc.</p>
